@host = https://localhost:7186

### 1. Đăng nhập
# Điền email và mật khẩu vào http-client.env.json.user (file này không được commit), rồi chọn môi trường dev ở góc trên bên phải
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

### 2. Gọi API có token (phải ra danh sách)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/features
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### 3. Làm mới token (phải ra cặp token mới)
# @name refresh
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "{{login.response.body.$.refresh_token}}" }

### 4. Dùng lại refresh token CŨ: phải ra 403 và phiên bị hủy
POST {{host}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refresh_token": "{{login.response.body.$.refresh_token}}" }

### 5. Sau mục 4, access token mới cũng phải bị 401
GET {{host}}/api/admin/features
Authorization: Bearer {{refresh.response.body.$.access_token}}


### A. Create a draft page
# @name page
POST {{host}}/api/admin/pages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Về chúng tôi", "slug": "ve-chung-toi", "seo_title": "Về Aura", "seo_description": "Giới thiệu công ty" }

### B. Add a rich_text section (the <script> must be removed in the response)
# @name sec
POST {{host}}/api/admin/pages/{{page.response.body.$.id}}/sections
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "rich_text", "content": { "html": "<p>Xin chào</p><script>alert(1)</script>" } }

### C. Draft page must NOT be public (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/api/public/pages/ve-chung-toi

### D. Publish
POST {{host}}/api/admin/pages/{{page.response.body.$.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### E. Now public (expect 200 with sections)
GET {{host}}/api/public/pages/ve-chung-toi

### F. Duplicate slug (expect 409)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/pages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Trùng", "slug": "ve-chung-toi" }

### G. Reserved slug (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/pages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Admin", "slug": "admin" }

### H. Menu: parent "Giới thiệu" with a child pointing at the page
# @name menu1
POST {{host}}/api/admin/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "Giới thiệu" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "Về chúng tôi", "parent_id": "{{menu1.response.body.$.id}}", "page_id": "{{page.response.body.$.id}}" }

### I. Public menu tree
GET {{host}}/api/public/menu

### J. Bad URL (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/menu
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "label": "Xấu", "url": "javascript:alert(1)" }


### Test phase 2 
### A. Create a category
# @name cat
POST {{host}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Công nghệ", "slug": "cong-nghe", "description": "Bài viết về công nghệ" }

### B. Create a draft post (the <script> must be removed)
# @name post
POST {{host}}/api/admin/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "AI sẽ thay đổi phần mềm doanh nghiệp", "slug": "ai-thay-doi-phan-mem",
  "excerpt": "Tóm tắt ngắn", "content": "<p>Nội dung bài viết</p><script>alert(1)</script>",
  "category_ids": ["{{cat.response.body.$.id}}"] }

### C. Draft must NOT be public (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/api/public/blog/posts/ai-thay-doi-phan-mem

### D. Publish
POST {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{post.response.body.$.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### E. Public list and detail (expect 200, with category and related)
GET {{host}}/api/public/blog/posts

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/blog/posts/ai-thay-doi-phan-mem

### F. Filter and search
GET {{host}}/api/public/blog/posts?category=cong-nghe&q=AI

### G. Public categories (post_count = 1)
GET {{host}}/api/public/blog/categories

### H. Duplicate slug (expect 409)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Trùng", "slug": "ai-thay-doi-phan-mem", "content": "<p>x</p>" }

### I. Publish an empty post (expect 400)
# @name empty
POST {{host}}/api/admin/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bài rỗng", "slug": "bai-rong" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{empty.response.body.$.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### J. Archive: becomes 404 publicly
POST {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{post.response.body.$.id}}/archive
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/blog/posts/ai-thay-doi-phan-mem

### K. Admin list with filter and pagination
GET {{host}}/api/admin/posts?status=archived&page=1&page_size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### L. Delete the category: the post must remain (expect 200)
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/categories/{{cat.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/posts/{{post.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Test phase 3 (chạy lần lượt; mục P xoá hết dữ liệu thử)
### A. No token (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/projects

### B. Create a draft project with a gallery (the <script> must be removed)
# @name project
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dự án thử", "slug": "du-an-thu", "client_name": "Khách hàng thử", "industry": "Bán lẻ",
  "summary": "Tóm tắt ngắn", "content": "<p>Nội dung dự án</p><script>alert(1)</script>",
  "thumbnail_url": "/logo.png",
  "images": [ { "image_url": "/logo.png", "caption": "Ảnh một" }, { "image_url": "/hero.png" } ] }

### C. Draft must NOT be public (expect 404)
GET {{host}}/api/public/portfolio/projects/du-an-thu

### D. Publish
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projects/{{project.response.body.$.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### E. Public detail (expect 200, no <script>, 2 images in order) and public list
GET {{host}}/api/public/portfolio/projects/du-an-thu

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/portfolio/projects

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/portfolio/slugs

### F. Duplicate slug (expect 409)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Trùng", "slug": "DU-AN-THU", "content": "<p>x</p>" }

### G. Unsafe gallery image (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Xấu", "slug": "du-an-xau", "images": [ { "image_url": "javascript:alert(1)" } ] }

### H. Publish an empty project (expect 400)
# @name emptyProject
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dự án rỗng", "slug": "du-an-rong" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projects/{{emptyProject.response.body.$.id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### I. Move the empty project up (expect 204; it comes first in the admin list)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projects/{{emptyProject.response.body.$.id}}/move?direction=up
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### J. Update replaces the gallery (admin detail must show 1 image, status still published)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/projects/{{project.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dự án thử đã sửa", "slug": "du-an-thu", "content": "<p>Nội dung mới</p>",
  "images": [ { "image_url": "/moi.png", "caption": "Ảnh mới" } ] }

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/projects/{{project.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### K. Unpublish: becomes 404 publicly
POST {{host}}/api/admin/projects/{{project.response.body.$.id}}/unpublish
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/portfolio/projects/du-an-thu

### L. Team member, unsafe photo (expect 400), public list
# @name member
POST {{host}}/api/admin/team-members
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "  Thành viên thử  ", "role": "Kỹ sư", "bio": "Giới thiệu ngắn", "photo_url": "/logo.png" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/team-members
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Xấu", "photo_url": "javascript:alert(1)" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/team

### M. Hide the member: disappears from the public list
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/team-members/{{member.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Thành viên thử", "role": "Kỹ sư", "is_published": false }

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/team

### N. Testimonial and public list
# @name testimonial
POST {{host}}/api/admin/testimonials
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "quote": "Câu đánh giá thử", "name": "Khách thử", "role": "Giám đốc", "avatar_url": "/logo.png" }

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/testimonials

### O. Pricing plan: blank features are removed, unsafe link (expect 400), update keeps the new features
# @name plan
POST {{host}}/api/admin/pricing-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gói thử", "price": "Liên hệ", "period": "tháng", "description": "Mô tả gói",
  "features": ["Quyền lợi một", "   ", "Quyền lợi hai"], "highlighted": true,
  "cta_text": "Liên hệ", "cta_link": "/#contact" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/admin/pricing-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Xấu", "cta_link": "javascript:alert(1)" }

###
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/pricing-plans/{{plan.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Gói thử", "features": ["Quyền lợi mới"] }

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/pricing

### P. Clean up everything created above (expect 204 each)
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/projects/{{project.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/projects/{{emptyProject.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/team-members/{{member.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/testimonials/{{testimonial.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/pricing-plans/{{plan.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Q. A page cannot use the reserved slug "pricing" (expect 400)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/pages
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bảng giá", "slug": "pricing" }

### Test phase 4 (chạy lần lượt sau khi chạy 006_leads_ai.sql; mục M xoá dữ liệu thử và tắt trợ lý)
### A. No token (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/leads

### B. Assistant settings: off by default
# @name settings
GET {{host}}/api/admin/ai/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### C. Public config says off, sending is refused (expect 403)
GET {{host}}/api/public/chat/config

###
POST {{host}}/api/public/chat/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "xin chào" }

### D. Turn the assistant on
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/ai/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bot_name": "Trợ lý Aura", "welcome_message": "Xin chào, mình là trợ lý của Aura.", "fallback_message": "Mình chưa có thông tin về việc này. Bạn để lại liên hệ nhé.", "is_enabled": true, "daily_message_limit": 300, "session_message_limit": 30 }

### E. Status: provider and what the assistant knows
GET {{host}}/api/admin/ai/status
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### F. Ask about published content (reply and sources from your posts or FAQ). Saves session_token
# @name chat
POST {{host}}/api/public/chat/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Phần mềm quản lý tồn kho như thế nào?", "page_url": "/blog" }

### G. Off-topic question (expect the fallback message, suggest_lead true, no sources)
POST {{host}}/api/public/chat/messages
X-Chat-Session: {{chat.response.body.$.session_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "message": "Thời tiết Hà Nội hôm nay thế nào?" }

### H. History needs the token (expect 2 turns, then an empty list without it)
GET {{host}}/api/public/chat/messages
X-Chat-Session: {{chat.response.body.$.session_token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/public/chat/messages

### I. Leave contact: no phone or email (expect 400), then valid
POST {{host}}/api/public/chat/lead
X-Chat-Session: {{chat.response.body.$.session_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Khách thử" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/public/chat/lead
X-Chat-Session: {{chat.response.body.$.session_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Khách thử Phase 4", "phone": "0900 000 000" }

### J. The lead appears with source chatbot
# @name leads
GET {{host}}/api/admin/leads?source=chatbot&q=Khách thử Phase 4
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### K. Update status and notes, bad status (expect 400)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/leads/{{leads.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "contacted", "notes": "Ghi chú thử" }

###
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/leads/{{leads.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "khong-hop-le" }

### L. Conversation list and transcript (no token_hash anywhere)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/chats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/admin/chats/{{leads.response.body.$.items[0].chat_session_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### M. Clean up: delete the lead and the chat (expect 204 each), turn the assistant off
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/chats/{{leads.response.body.$.items[0].chat_session_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/leads/{{leads.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/ai/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bot_name": "Trợ lý Aura", "welcome_message": "Xin chào, mình là trợ lý của Aura.", "fallback_message": "Mình chưa có thông tin về việc này. Bạn để lại liên hệ nhé.", "is_enabled": false, "daily_message_limit": 300, "session_message_limit": 30 }
